        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises RPD-150, Solid Brass 1-1/2 Drop Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1-1/2 Inch Drop Ring Pull has an elongated shape that makes it a classic. This stylish Solid Brass 1-1/2 Drop Ring Pull is a great addition to any kitchen cabinet, but that isn't the only application for this finger pull. It is easy to install and can be used on almost any lightweight door or drawer such as those on closets, dressers, and end tables. The Drop 1-1/2 Inch Ring Pull is available in a wide array of finishes for an end look that suits your style.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/2-1-2-inch-drop-ring-pull-field-enterprises-rpd-250\">Large Drop Finger Ring Pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Drop RPD150 Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
